{"4833540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Juice Stand Tycoon", "steam_appid": 4833540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4905300], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/extras/89eb18e8f9c22b3d82061cd1b5358de6.avif?t=1784158957\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/extras_big/89eb18e8f9c22b3d82061cd1b5358de6.webp?t=1784158957 width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juice Stand Tycoon is a casual business simulation game about growing a small neighborhood juice stand into a busy local favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day starts with planning. Buy ingredients, adjust your recipes, set prices, and decide whether to spend money on upgrades or advertising. Then open the stand and see how your choices play out as customers arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather and location matter. Sunny days can boost demand for cold drinks, rain can slow traffic, and each level brings new pressure as your customer flow grows. Keep enough cups, fruit, sugar, and ice in stock, price your drinks fairly, and build your reputation one day at a time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/extras/a0ed96e43987da18ec7539b04bae5f42.avif?t=1784158957\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/extras_big/a0ed96e43987da18ec7539b04bae5f42.webp?t=1784158957 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run and grow your own juice stand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients and manage daily stock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices and adjust recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stand with useful improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend money on ads to attract more customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to weather, demand, and customer flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new products and progress through multiple levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juice Stand Tycoon is easy to pick up, relaxed to play, and satisfying to optimize as your little stand becomes a better business.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/extras/89eb18e8f9c22b3d82061cd1b5358de6.avif?t=1784158957\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/extras_big/89eb18e8f9c22b3d82061cd1b5358de6.webp?t=1784158957 width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juice Stand Tycoon is a casual business simulation game about growing a small neighborhood juice stand into a busy local favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day starts with planning. Buy ingredients, adjust your recipes, set prices, and decide whether to spend money on upgrades or advertising. Then open the stand and see how your choices play out as customers arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather and location matter. Sunny days can boost demand for cold drinks, rain can slow traffic, and each level brings new pressure as your customer flow grows. Keep enough cups, fruit, sugar, and ice in stock, price your drinks fairly, and build your reputation one day at a time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/extras/a0ed96e43987da18ec7539b04bae5f42.avif?t=1784158957\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/extras_big/a0ed96e43987da18ec7539b04bae5f42.webp?t=1784158957 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run and grow your own juice stand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients and manage daily stock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices and adjust recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stand with useful improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend money on ads to attract more customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to weather, demand, and customer flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new products and progress through multiple levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juice Stand Tycoon is easy to pick up, relaxed to play, and satisfying to optimize as your little stand becomes a better business.</p>", "short_description": "Run your own cozy juice stand. Set prices, manage ingredients, upgrade your stand, handle weather, launch ads, and serve more customers as your little business grows.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/cb38085ba5e608a65888db622d1953faea70ff11/header.jpg?t=1784158957", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/fd3c0e80eb90ca0c4df0b43d6ffae22a1f81d9af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784158957", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833540/fd3c0e80eb90ca0c4df0b43d6ffae22a1f81d9af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784158957", "website": "https://treebytesoftware.com/juice-stand-tycoon", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU, NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD Ra